 give you advice to help  you out the other part of that is so  that's great you're out there you're  talking people you really clear and you  will get people who can help you the  second part is you don't have to get  mentored by people who you actually know  and i found that i've got a lot of  advice and I can sit a lot of people to  be my mentors and people I look up to  who have never actually met and I  learned  about them through books I read and  stories online and profiles that we even  do in a my own website and I call it  modern masters where you're looking at  famous entrepreneurs who look up to and  you get their advice by listening to how  they started their business and I find a  lot of value in that hopefully you know  you guys do as well and that's why we do  the regular videos on it but you know  what I'm looking for marketing device  there's people who I know who I can talk  to about marketing but I also look at  guys like Richard Branson and how did  they market their business and guys like  Donald Trump and how do they promote  themselves there's lessons you can learn  success leaves clues I look into these  famous entrepreneurs who look up to and  a tent it helps to look at people who  are inspiring to you and whose story you  really appreciate anything you can  resonate well with and you can have them  as your informal Board of Advisors you  know how would I market like Richard  Branson as an example and they can help  you grow your business as well even  though you've never actually met them so  both sides of the corn again it's still  going to come down to really being clear  of their what you need help with asking  people exactly for that help and then  also looking to other resources beyond  your network looking up the famous  entrepreneur is the same lessons you can  learn from their success so hopefully  that helps you start that business and  grow it and you can build that better  life for for you and your daughter good  luck if you have